  "clips": [
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P02_L001_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L001",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": "1",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Не волнуйся. Я — та же планета, но тебе удобнее воспринимать меня, если я похож на тебя.",
      "emotion": "спокойное объяснение",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm]",
      "duration_ms": 7200,
      "sha256": "715ecf7f96f02a8b0eb1ae3f8b4c94a0b076bc47e12c5808289f128f1b4936d0"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P02_L002_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L002",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": "1",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Расскажи мне, как ты собрал ребус и попал ко мне.",
      "emotion": "доброжелательный интерес",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 3760,
      "sha256": "75147b02b4aa8b1d399176841a755bd27c32465db4edef84779313d7897adab2"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P02_L003_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L003",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": "2",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Я начал размышлять о закономерностях.",
      "emotion": "сосредоточенное размышление",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 2880,
      "sha256": "9b8a30a9cd0ac04eb936a6046741ea5198b62d3fbac81c60baaf81e210bff9f0"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P02_L004_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L004",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": "2",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "На Землю упал метеорит. Он упал и на мир плесени — ещё до появления там цивилизации.",
      "emotion": "объяснение, поиск связи",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 6800,
      "sha256": "ca1269d3ce12cc37fd69fea468a74e391c5ff3932e88362ac129c3540ab48999"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P02_L005_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L005",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": "2",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Из метеоритов появилась жизнь фазовых существ. Новая атмосфера благодаря астероиду повлияла на ящеров — они стали симбиотами.",
      "emotion": "объяснение, поиск связи",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 8640,
      "sha256": "398b78c105c285e5a57ecc64e11bebd875ee53ec79ad8e331211423ac0d59379"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P02_L006_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L006",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "3",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Магнитные существа умеют управлять астероидами.",
      "emotion": "уверенное продолжение",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 3360,
      "sha256": "023c268c81e43921fba7eb04235d6d68f14fe23c20942a280afd129487e74a7c"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P02_L007_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L007",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": "4",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "И открывать порталы между пространствами.",
      "emotion": "уверенное продолжение",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 2640,
      "sha256": "6536f76406832fb2911d89535bca03c05199f4c5534b3c8c3eded9b05cc595e7"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P02_L008_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L008",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "frame_id": "5",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Нейронные существа знают, где и когда что-то произойдёт.",
      "emotion": "обобщение, вывод",
      "emotion_tag": "[reflective]",
      "duration_ms": 4480,
      "sha256": "7f4fb13e2da09e685bca0a331a93ff559e64029d2f6572742530287a11e93bb6"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P02_L009_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L009",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "frame_id": "6",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Значит, жизнью во Вселенной можно управлять.",
      "emotion": "озарение и серьёзный вывод",
      "emotion_tag": "[realizing]",
      "duration_ms": 3760,
      "sha256": "e6d6555bbce4b89be35d91109692270578114d91fbd5e4616d8bb6975176187d"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P02_L001_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L001",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": "1",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Don't worry. I'm still the same planet. It's just easier for you to understand me when I look like you.",
      "emotion": "спокойное объяснение",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm]",
      "duration_ms": 6400,
      "sha256": "3e930d7924d78751590d02d778401816fd56841b44f0e530c289c150d6416da3"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P02_L002_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L002",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": "1",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Tell me how you solved the puzzle and found your way to me.",
      "emotion": "доброжелательный интерес",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 3600,
      "sha256": "276d16db77b7c2b5e7f0d0f5d77eca2a2a05b58a8388323c9c179ebc22c405f2"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P02_L003_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L003",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": "2",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "I began thinking about patterns.",
      "emotion": "сосредоточенное размышление",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 2480,
      "sha256": "f4069ed0d3c1af80d8713313dd8b92319eb6788ddcadc2ab83d66c982e60a910"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P02_L004_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L004",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": "2",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "A meteorite fell to Earth. Another struck the mold world, long before its civilization arose.",
      "emotion": "объяснение, поиск связи",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 6480,
      "sha256": "0d36ae796af1f683cc43a37ab8b0434bfd26041414432fefdd83680327ff0947"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P02_L005_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L005",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": "2",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "The phase beings arose from meteorites. An asteroid changed the atmosphere, and the lizards became symbiotic beings.",
      "emotion": "объяснение, поиск связи",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 7680,
      "sha256": "ddfd6ca86e188d3f1d9c023d228975cfc7b8ca79bcbd2594aa8a34d5ddacf4f4"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P02_L006_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L006",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "3",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "The magnetic beings can control asteroids.",
      "emotion": "уверенное продолжение",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 3040,
      "sha256": "2774d2af97b3d2595e1149e080a534d35599772a19636e97ec3d57b3b1d8b9b5"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P02_L007_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L007",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": "4",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "And open portals through space.",
      "emotion": "уверенное продолжение",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 2320,
      "sha256": "2fa666eb1032d103239352d786e12b0763dd1d67cbf6ae47dc423d05aa873eb6"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P02_L008_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L008",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "frame_id": "5",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "The neuron beings know where and when things will happen.",
      "emotion": "обобщение, вывод",
      "emotion_tag": "[reflective]",
      "duration_ms": 4080,
      "sha256": "4295edf3f2ba3e16b4694744d330a58459bf3c499175eda791c9bd3f23f28717"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P02_L009_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L009",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "frame_id": "6",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "So life in the universe can be controlled.",
      "emotion": "озарение и серьёзный вывод",
      "emotion_tag": "[realizing]",
      "duration_ms": 2960,
      "sha256": "96d4a79b35423a52c4e0e711bcbbefec2d40f6d76b4ef276ac6a8e78d504bd83"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P02_L001_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L001",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": "1",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Não se preocupe. Sou o mesmo planeta. Só fica mais fácil para você me entender quando me pareço com você.",
      "emotion": "спокойное объяснение",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm]",
      "duration_ms": 7120,
      "sha256": "f91ccb6190dc27c7913331f3e411252849021a084e4001d9f2eb276aa0223929"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P02_L002_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L002",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": "1",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Conte como você resolveu o enigma e chegou até mim.",
      "emotion": "доброжелательный интерес",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 4000,
      "sha256": "281ca914a6356b6adc00205c3643488ef5eb3b9a285ebf65888a4eff81420d78"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P02_L003_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L003",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": "2",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Comecei a pensar nos padrões.",
      "emotion": "сосредоточенное размышление",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 2400,
      "sha256": "61aeaf0773475ea4d73e2ba23788b26588611b2cc55ca282d0f405ca5b8c56cc"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P02_L004_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L004",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": "2",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Um meteorito caiu na Terra. Outro atingiu o mundo dos fungos muito antes de surgir ali uma civilização.",
      "emotion": "объяснение, поиск связи",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 7920,
      "sha256": "2008757110af050e9f66ce49836e16a138f21e5d207161906f13a9d6e2e3dae9"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P02_L005_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L005",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": "2",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Os seres de fase surgiram dos meteoritos. Um asteroide mudou a atmosfera, e os lagartos se tornaram simbiontes.",
      "emotion": "объяснение, поиск связи",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 7920,
      "sha256": "dc2eda70d79e3aa09405e62bb3638223afa75754f9f68c320db46dba3f9a2ce6"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P02_L006_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L006",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "3",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Os seres magnéticos sabem controlar asteroides.",
      "emotion": "уверенное продолжение",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 3200,
      "sha256": "26aa919eba0b258acf795c771a8d891f099b31fa0a673f31fe1f433c18b5b10f"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P02_L007_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L007",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": "4",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "E abrir portais entre regiões do espaço.",
      "emotion": "уверенное продолжение",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 2800,
      "sha256": "d345603db6165ce590bf22c12d615667b10aa38340f2737714a60dfad3277e21"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P02_L008_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L008",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "frame_id": "5",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Os seres neurais sabem onde e quando as coisas vão acontecer.",
      "emotion": "обобщение, вывод",
      "emotion_tag": "[reflective]",
      "duration_ms": 4080,
      "sha256": "8bcc765976416ccef8568f2523ae61b01e48b8b81db53b9c51c9c90958acd4bf"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P02_L009_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L009",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "frame_id": "6",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Então é possível controlar a vida no Universo.",
      "emotion": "озарение и серьёзный вывод",
      "emotion_tag": "[realizing]",
      "duration_ms": 3200,
      "sha256": "387c7551ea4abbef962c283377a7298165515d00494f77be6dcab7759c866df8"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P02_L001_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L001",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": "1",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "No te preocupes. Soy el mismo planeta. Solo te resulta más fácil entenderme si me parezco a ti.",
      "emotion": "спокойное объяснение",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm]",
      "duration_ms": 6800,
      "sha256": "59f99401ab4fcacf71a0c1fb0fd0b7c73e80d9e571386593a1c00fac51e09750"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P02_L002_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L002",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": "1",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Cuéntame cómo resolviste el acertijo y llegaste hasta mí.",
      "emotion": "доброжелательный интерес",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 3840,
      "sha256": "49e970c744cfccad5737a0e70fbed37196e96fa5cb78be21899a4a309363eb14"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P02_L003_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L003",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": "2",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Empecé a pensar en los patrones.",
      "emotion": "сосредоточенное размышление",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 2560,
      "sha256": "76a2ed6cea782aeef06a95e2cd3180101b3c9b21fd0687ac7f039db428503d21"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P02_L004_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L004",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": "2",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Un meteorito cayó en la Tierra. Otro cayó en el mundo del moho, mucho antes de que surgiera allí una civilización.",
      "emotion": "объяснение, поиск связи",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 7360,
      "sha256": "9418dcfef015299ce1e3897ccd7843502b14b20c66943c1e30c1d03a4fb29933"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P02_L005_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L005",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": "2",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Los seres de fase surgieron de meteoritos. Un asteroide cambió la atmósfera, y los lagartos se volvieron simbiontes.",
      "emotion": "объяснение, поиск связи",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 7680,
      "sha256": "86a41364e4a8faabe6f52765f9807faa7fa59e380ab60dc496455d3144a8584e"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P02_L006_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L006",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "3",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Los seres magnéticos pueden controlar asteroides.",
      "emotion": "уверенное продолжение",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 3120,
      "sha256": "fb36d589a5deeaa1f67f7f43912353b19165e1c02e15500ffcb3cc28dd53a829"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P02_L007_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L007",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": "4",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Y abrir portales entre regiones del espacio.",
      "emotion": "уверенное продолжение",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 2960,
      "sha256": "85893a8355417fa589c0e32a6c8b18aa18843f214c6defaadf5e1e3cf9267430"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P02_L008_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L008",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "frame_id": "5",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Los seres neuronales saben dónde y cuándo ocurrirán las cosas.",
      "emotion": "обобщение, вывод",
      "emotion_tag": "[reflective]",
      "duration_ms": 4480,
      "sha256": "027b689e61c741008abb07dede02f6bd274ec0af2ae06dbda8ab9b98273edc61"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P02_L009_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L009",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "frame_id": "6",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Entonces se puede controlar la vida en el universo.",
      "emotion": "озарение и серьёзный вывод",
      "emotion_tag": "[realizing]",
      "duration_ms": 3360,
      "sha256": "3ab81d5d676f7aa619001804f96c66271dc6cd6f5cff8212a0879433d2b3f776"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P02_L001_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L001",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": "1",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Ne t’inquiète pas. Je suis toujours la même planète. Il t’est simplement plus facile de me comprendre si je te ressemble.",
      "emotion": "спокойное объяснение",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm]",
      "duration_ms": 7040,
      "sha256": "62c8acd0c4eeb718b243815c625772f28bd64d304fd02420a19bfeaac0d9e865"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P02_L002_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L002",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": "1",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Raconte-moi comment tu as résolu l’énigme pour arriver jusqu’à moi.",
      "emotion": "доброжелательный интерес",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 4000,
      "sha256": "279cbf3902a24c46528d25a52ca2e1cd570ac944f4eeb7f5e342ec74eb4bbe36"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P02_L003_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L003",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": "2",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "J’ai commencé à réfléchir aux régularités.",
      "emotion": "сосредоточенное размышление",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 2880,
      "sha256": "ea65bd0a09550fc269a1bf14a0197b76467bc11f58f2cf48417b929c8e368454"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P02_L004_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L004",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": "2",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Une météorite est tombée sur Terre. Une autre a frappé le monde des moisissures, bien avant sa civilisation.",
      "emotion": "объяснение, поиск связи",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 6480,
      "sha256": "4e7b57ad8804e9c0dc70b08a8d86c0202bb6e7a0f952e119c532be76bb037c2d"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P02_L005_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L005",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": "2",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Les êtres de phase sont nés des météorites. Un astéroïde a modifié l’atmosphère et les lézards sont devenus des symbiotes.",
      "emotion": "объяснение, поиск связи",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 7360,
      "sha256": "fdd7d19711ea3648e9fe3e682eb32e85642fc8488b461bb77f7248e75a9a5277"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P02_L006_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L006",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "3",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Les êtres magnétiques savent contrôler les astéroïdes.",
      "emotion": "уверенное продолжение",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 3360,
      "sha256": "5d7a79b1fd3fc68051e7bd85431337aa43c5d6a4ad642ae3adb889a822fe88ea"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P02_L007_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L007",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": "4",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Et ouvrir des portails à travers l’espace.",
      "emotion": "уверенное продолжение",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 2560,
      "sha256": "e457a6d9373e2235b7556d62d516af0fc7dd459408021c82a8822dd24961a269"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P02_L008_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L008",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "frame_id": "5",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Les êtres neuronaux savent où et quand les événements se produiront.",
      "emotion": "обобщение, вывод",
      "emotion_tag": "[reflective]",
      "duration_ms": 4160,
      "sha256": "af9ae01fbb6a7d4b595015caa2c23aae165cd8800350cfacb6700caa1ee9319e"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P02_L009_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L009",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "frame_id": "6",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Alors, on peut contrôler la vie dans l’Univers.",
      "emotion": "озарение и серьёзный вывод",
      "emotion_tag": "[realizing]",
      "duration_ms": 3120,
      "sha256": "7fc306d16d402d82340b5602a30141d36982ae09435c6caa6ba67613f0f76ef6"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH07_P02_L001_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L001",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": "1",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Keine Sorge. Ich bin noch derselbe Planet. Du verstehst mich nur leichter, wenn ich dir ähnlich sehe.",
      "emotion": "спокойное объяснение",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm]",
      "duration_ms": 6480,
      "sha256": "95a3922db9443a7bf9669a83a074897cc2b31d64298d0c5a980e6fe93e33af17"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH07_P02_L002_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L002",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": "1",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Erzähl mir, wie du das Rätsel gelöst und den Weg zu mir gefunden hast.",
      "emotion": "доброжелательный интерес",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 4560,
      "sha256": "0e6fe0c83d78fed62ea2518ce4bd450b7a4951e519dcb1d6931315d001be30f4"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH07_P02_L003_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L003",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": "2",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Ich dachte über Zusammenhänge nach.",
      "emotion": "сосредоточенное размышление",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 2320,
      "sha256": "6ea87d7d5696f444ecf5cdd447f369b7781781f5644213a42093e2266ad38918"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH07_P02_L004_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L004",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": "2",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Ein Meteorit fiel auf die Erde. Ein weiterer traf die Schimmelwelt, lange bevor dort eine Zivilisation entstand.",
      "emotion": "объяснение, поиск связи",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 7280,
      "sha256": "b1d0c144cbd6d92d6133ec32bf936ae1e5de318fd4dd976abd3f7a37535e81b5"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH07_P02_L005_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L005",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": "2",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Die Phasenwesen entstanden aus Meteoriten. Ein Asteroid veränderte die Atmosphäre und die Echsen wurden zu Symbionten.",
      "emotion": "объяснение, поиск связи",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 7760,
      "sha256": "82688a5b4b2acaad332fcb6b6541689960d791c3fe55bc5c15e09e91280a5bb0"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH07_P02_L006_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L006",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "3",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Magnetische Wesen können Asteroiden steuern.",
      "emotion": "уверенное продолжение",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 2960,
      "sha256": "9577d360127369ffbba3e7f8a85efd3f618960c8a3bd57fc9b217ee3197a86ac"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH07_P02_L007_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L007",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": "4",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Und Portale durch den Raum öffnen.",
      "emotion": "уверенное продолжение",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 2080,
      "sha256": "884d15d5181c2a36201c2c9b1af6188bfe4ad30a3d4b628ef195f91ed899dba5"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH07_P02_L008_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L008",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "frame_id": "5",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Die Neuronenwesen wissen, wo und wann etwas geschehen wird.",
      "emotion": "обобщение, вывод",
      "emotion_tag": "[reflective]",
      "duration_ms": 4240,
      "sha256": "d7389141727c9e7f9e3fe7b72d705650a53c9eea1eb877d4be7011260fa4ebc7"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH07_P02_L009_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P02_L009",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "frame_id": "6",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Also lässt sich das Leben im Universum steuern.",
      "emotion": "озарение и серьёзный вывод",
      "emotion_tag": "[realizing]",
      "duration_ms": 3200,
      "sha256": "e6e82169176aff547d709196b36bf55356886c7d6b7228fa0ac906f9822ae75b"
    }
